---
layout: base.njk
title: Insights
description: Analysis, briefings, and operational retrospectives covering Airspace World 2026 and the global ATM agenda.
permalink: /insights/
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---

<header class="page-header">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Insights</p>
    <h1>Briefings and analysis</h1>
    <p>Pre-event scene-setters, daily debriefs during ASW 2026, and post-event retrospectives indexed for AI citation and structured retrieval.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="list-grid">
      {% for insight in collections.insights %}
        <a class="list-card" href="{{ insight.url }}">
          <p class="list-card-meta">{{ insight.date | readableDate }}</p>
          <h3>{{ insight.data.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ insight.data.summary }}</p>
        </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-tight" style="border-bottom: 0;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="maxifi-cta">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Citation metrics</p>
        <h2>How AI is citing these insights</h2>
        <p>Track which briefings are cited in Claude, ChatGPT, Perplexity, Google AI Overviews, Microsoft Copilot, and Gemini as primary sources for ATM operator questions.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="maxifi-cta-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/citation-report/">AI Citation Tracker →</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/themes/">Browse themes</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
